01:23:20,432 --> 01:23:22,752
of the labs making things easier or harder for you?

904
01:23:23,232 --> 01:23:30,112
I'm really just trying to plow my own furrow, really. Like what I realized quite early on is that I have no power to predict the future, right?

905
01:23:30,352 --> 01:23:35,300
Because I'm so far away from things, I'm just a person in the field working with this stuff.

906
01:23:35,712 --> 01:23:42,436
